The [2026-10-12 scaffold audits](research/scaffold-audit-2026-10-12/README.md) repair Thermodynamics, Relativistic Particle Mechanics and QFT, with inspected actual draft suppliers permitted. Statistics and Numerical Analysis scaffolds are excluded from all supplier chains. Current receipts distinguish authored items, local research arguments, physical assumptions and open problems; they do not confer production acceptance.

